<title>INDIA: RBI data on exchange market operations.</title>
<headline>RBI data on exchange market operations.</headline>
<text>
<p>RESERVE BANK OF INDIA'S EXCHANGE MARKET OPERATIONS</p>
<p>Month	Purchases*  Sales*   Net	 Cum net     Outst</p>
<p>					purch(+)/   purch(+)/   forward</p>
<p>					 sales(-)   sales (-) liabilities</p>
<p>	    ($ million)					 (month end)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>1995</p>
<p>Oct		    7     792    -785	  -785	    20</p>
<p>Nov		  290     401    -111	  -896	   248</p>
<p>Dec		  272     328     -56	  -952	   456</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>Jan		1,368   1,770    -402	-1,354	 2,236</p>
<p>Feb		  140     468    -328	 1,682	 2,316</p>
<p>March	    1,135     175    +960	  -722	 2,216</p>
<p>April		577     209    +368	  -354	 2,007</p>
<p>May		  336     235    +101	  -253	 2,058</p>
<p>June	     1,150     365    +785	  +532	 1,799</p>
<p>		  ----------------------</p>
<p>Total	     5,275   4,743   +532</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------- * includes spot, forward and swap transactions which have been effected during the month.</p>
<p>Note - Under column 4, (-) denotes net sales from the foreign currency assets and (+) denotes net accretion to the foreign currency assets.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
